# Every entry says why the finding does not apply. Remove the entry when the reason stops being true.

# Containerfile: the release stage is gcr.io/distroless/cc-debian13:nonroot, which sets a non-root
# user (65532) in the image config; trivy only looks for a USER line.
DS-0002

# Containerfile: health is checked by the platform over HTTP (/probe/live, /probe/ready);
# distroless has no shell or curl for a Docker HEALTHCHECK.
DS-0026
